e_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":24},"text":"人为什么会恋爱脑?看了《黄帝内经》后我茅塞顿开，书中说：“体弱则托情，情深则不寿”。凡是情感丰富细腻的人，大部分体质都偏弱。\n因为体虚的人，肾不能主志，肝不能主魂，肺不能主魄，那就容易：失魂落魄，容易失去自我。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2096946837446082581"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2096941572705439927","created_at":"2026-09-07T12:40:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096941572705439927"],"id":"2096941572705439927","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":159,"impression_count":71325,"like_count":2002,"quote_count":36,"reply_count":138,"retweet_count":346},"text":"爱欲是比性欲更难熬的东西，性欲尚可自我排解，但爱欲是幽灵，它会在某个夜晚降临在我身上，让我彻夜难眠，蜷缩成一团流泪，想要拥抱你，想要亲吻你，这样的欲望，我是无能为力的。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2096941572705439927"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2096939904815259889","created_at":"2026-09-07T12:33:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096939904815259889"],"id":"2096939904815259889","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1812,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"克制和自省是比欲望更疯狂的东西","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2096939904815259889"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2096891148786934162","created_at":"2026-09-07T09:19:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096891148786934162"],"id":"2096891148786934162","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":58,"impression_count":6382,"like_count":175,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":34},"text":"专注的本质是：大量的拒绝，大量的筛选，不断地聚焦，不断地沉浸，从而进入心流状态；在心无旁骛的过程中，提升自己，与此同时，对无效社交祛魅。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2096891148786934162"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2096889524811076015","created_at":"2026-09-07T09:13:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096889524811076015"],"id":"2096889524811076015","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":4003,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":8},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2096810663872197004","type":"quoted"}